:27,"end":49},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-7fc2c40720129e9ed48e","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-1954f1577f0c58b22fca","layer":"pei","quote":"又杨暨表曰：“武皇帝始征张鲁，以十万之众，身亲临履，指授方略，因就民麦以为军粮。张卫之守，盖不足言，地险守易；虽有精兵虎将，势不能施。对兵三日，欲抽军还，言：‘作军三十年，一朝持与人，如何？’此计已定，天祚大魏，鲁守自坏，因以定之","attribution":"裴注·魏名臣奏","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":308,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-0c873df6029964ad38a0","start":0,"end":115},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-b3d5c19d61f972ae0ce9","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-9ba8257c047e00b51042","layer":"pei","quote":"武皇帝，承凉州从事及武都降人之辞，说‘张鲁易攻，阳平城下南北山相远，不可守也’，信以为然。及往临履，不如所闻，乃叹曰：‘他人商度，少如人意！’攻阳平山上诸屯，既不时拔，士卒伤夷者多。武皇帝意沮，便欲拔军，截山而还。遣故大将军夏侯惇、将军许褚，呼山上兵还。会前军未还，夜迷惑；误入贼营，贼便退散。侍中辛毗、刘晔等在兵后，语惇、褚，言：‘官兵已据得贼要屯，贼已散走。’犹不信之，惇前自见，乃还白武皇帝。进兵定之，幸而克获。此近事，吏士所知","attribution":"裴注·魏名臣奏","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":307,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-0c873df6029964ad38a0","start":16,"end":233},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-bb09dcc2706efd4bbfa0","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-6a1c95ed57c00b446116","layer":"original","quote":"鲁闻阳平已陷，将稽颡〖10〗。圃又曰：“今以迫往〖11〗，功必轻；不如依杜（灌）〔濩〕赴朴胡相拒，然后委质〖12〗，功必多。”于是乃奔南山入巴中","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":287,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":63,"end":135},{"id":"huangli-q-4f391fe6950149b60fdc","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-b937b741ffd9fc15238b","layer":"original","quote":"然卒破杜濩、朴胡〖2〗，杀夏侯渊，据汉中：皆权本谋也","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":10,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":80,"end":106},{"id":"huangli-q-8bf7c6db5590fc0ed2c2","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-486f9fcee6c41bd3de4a","layer":"original","quote":"随杜濩、朴胡诣洛阳，假校尉","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":157,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":25,"end":38},{"id":"huangli-q2-8ec763646120744b2ac2","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-b937b741ffd9fc15238b","layer":"original","quote":"先主假权偏将军。﹝一﹞及曹公破张鲁，鲁走入巴中。权进曰：“若失汉中，则三巴不振〖1〗，此为割蜀之股臂也！”于是先主以权为护军，率诸将迎鲁；鲁已还南郑，北降曹公。然卒破杜濩、朴胡〖2〗，杀夏侯渊，据汉中：皆权本谋也。","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":10,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":107},{"id":"wudi-e-o176b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-889ba56c5491dd0a8600","layer":"original","quote":"贼见大军退，其守备解散。公乃密遣解(、高祚等乘险夜袭。大破之，斩其将杨任。进攻卫，卫等夜遁；鲁溃，奔巴中〖11〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":322,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":47,"end":104},{"id":"wudi-e-o178a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-0d8ae785c96f5f9a0693","layer":"original","quote":"九月，巴七姓夷王朴胡、）邑侯杜濩举巴夷、）民来附〖16〗。﹝三﹞于是分巴郡〖17〗：以胡为巴东太守，濩为巴西太守，皆封列侯。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":324,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":62},{"id":"wudi-e-o195a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-a6c4894727ead1cc5e5d","layer":"original","quote":"夏侯渊与刘备战于阳平，为备所杀。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":423,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16},{"id":"wudi-q-b-e0a96bdd9353a663e5ab","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-e0a96bdd9353a663e5ab","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十年：建安二十年（公元 215 ）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":328,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-3bb2f11071aab1690790","start":0,"end":22},{"id":"wudi-q-o173","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fc2c779b81f1c3c13b40","layer":"original","quote":"二十年春正月〖1〗，天子立公中女为皇后〖2〗。省云中、定襄、五原、朔方郡〖3〗，郡置一县领其民；合以为新兴郡〖4〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":319,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":58},{"id":"wudi-q-o178","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-0d8ae785c96f5f9a0693","layer":"original","quote":"九月，巴七姓夷王朴胡、）邑侯杜濩举巴夷、）民来附〖16〗。﹝三﹞于是分巴郡〖17〗：以胡为巴东太守，濩为巴西太守，皆封列侯。天子命公承制封拜诸侯、守相〖18〗。﹝四﹞冬十月，始置名号侯至五大夫〖19〗。与旧列侯、关内侯凡六等〖20〗，以赏军功。﹝五﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":324,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":125},{"id":"wudi-q-p123","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-f0bb069f29dd31f40851","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞孙盛曰：“朴，音浮。濩，音户。”","attribution":"孙盛音释","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":353,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-2e25f7650823588b2b7f","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o045a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-1f07331b166b6f2880a1","layer":"original","quote":"是岁，曹公定汉中，张鲁遁走巴西。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":200,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
